  #line-at(72.024pt, 454.27pt, "Conclusions ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(96.024pt, 467.59pt, "In summary, we have developed a high-performance flexible thermoelectric device based on ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 481.39pt, "non-reciprocal heat transfer, which eliminates the dependence on complex heat sinks. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 495.19pt, "Thermoelectric films were fabricated via screen printing technology to further reduce internal ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 508.99pt, "thermal conductivity and extend the heat transfer path, while the high thermal conductivity flexible ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 522.79pt, "heat dissipation thin film further endows the heat flow with direction dependence. Our system ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 536.59pt, "exhibits excellent cooling and power generation capabilities at room temperature. It achieves a ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 550.39pt, "temperature reduction of 29.25 ℃ relative to the ambient temperature without any heat sink, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 564.19pt, "surpassing current state-of-the-art devices of the same type (Usually around 10℃). The cold-hot ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 577.99pt, "temperature difference can exceed 65 ℃, and a COP of approximately 1.5 is achieved at a cold-")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 591.79pt, "hot temperature difference of 29 ℃. Moreover, the heat sink-free design makes the device more ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 605.62pt, "convenient to wear and carry. It can be widely applied globally for human thermal management, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 619.42pt, "home healthcare, and surgeries in poor and under-developed regions in third-world countries. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 633.22pt, "Regarding power generation, the 7-unit device can achieve a potential difference of approximately ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 647.02pt, "15.6 mV under resting conditions, which further increases to about 26.1 mV during exercise. This ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 660.82pt, "design strategy extends the application scope of thermoelectric devices from traditional personal ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 674.62pt, "thermal management to a broader temperature range encompassing physical fever reduction, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 688.42pt, "edema/analgesia for sports or neurological injuries, and even surgical-grade ice caps.  ")
]

